      "http_status": 200,
      "seconds": 24.76,
      "answer": "VEBA is a system within the NAVAS platform that introduces marketplace behaviors such as asset listings, booking approvals, conflict alerts, and payments. It supports booking idle assets, real-time availability, and allows owners to approve or reject bookings. VEBA also manages usage history for scheduling maintenance and includes features like passenger booking flow, driver fatigue alert handling, and commission processing. It requires KYC verification, token deduction audits, and specific rules for handling payment disputes.",
